      <div class="worship-celestial" aria-hidden="true"><span class="worship-moon">☾</span><span class="worship-star worship-star-one">✦</span><span class="worship-star worship-star-two">✧</span><span class="worship-cloud worship-cloud-one"></span><span class="worship-cloud worship-cloud-two"></span></div>
      <header class="worship-intro"><p class="eyebrow">For the devoted</p><p class="worship-constellation" aria-hidden="true">✦&nbsp;✧&nbsp;✦</p><h1>What I <em>Offer.</em></h1></header>
      <div class="worship-prose offer-prose">
        <p>The moon doesn't do discounts. She doesn't do menus. She does tides, and tides move for the devoted.</p>
        <p>This page exists because the devoted kept asking. Here's what I give, to whom, and how it's earned. Read it carefully, because wanting something on this page isn't the same as qualifying for it.</p>
        <h2>What You Get <em>With Me.</em></h2>
        <p>Before the offerings, the constants. These don't depend on how much you tribute or how long you've been here. They're simply what it means to be Mine.</p>
        <p>I'm a gentle goddess. That surprises people, so let me say it clearly: I lead with warmth. I praise generously. I take care of the devoted who belong to me, genuinely, the way you take care of something rare. My power was never in cruelty. My power is that being seen by me feels like the best thing that's happened to you in years, and being disappointed by me feels like the worst.</p>
        <p>My attention, when you've earned it. I read what my Subs write. I remember it. I respond like a woman who was actually listening, because I was.</p>
        <p>My discretion, carefully maintained. What happens between us is treated with care. I do not publicly share names or identifying details; read my <a href="/privacy.php">Discretion &amp; Privacy</a> page for the current practices behind that commitment.</p>
        <p>My standards. You'll know exactly where you stand with me at all times. No guessing, no games, no cold shoulders without reason. When I go quiet, you'll know why. When I'm pleased, you'll feel it.</p>
        <h2>Sexting <em>Sessions.</em></h2>
        <p>The closest thing to having me, without the plane ticket.</p>
        <p>A real session, live, Mine, with my full attention on you and nothing else. I lead. You follow. I tell you what I'm doing, what I'd do to you, what I'd let you do to me, and I don't rush, because a woman who rushes wasn't worth the tribute in the first place.</p>
        <p>Sessions are priced by the hour, and the hour belongs entirely to you. Some of my Subs come to me to be undone. Some come to be praised until they forget every criticism they've ever carried. Some come with a specific fantasy they've never said out loud. Tell me which one you are when you book, and I'll build the session around it.</p>
        <p><strong>Available to:</strong> vetted applicants with a completed intake. First session requires a tribute before we start, no exceptions.</p>
        <h2>Audio Messages &amp; <em>Voice Notes.</em></h2>
        <p>Some of the devoted don't want the typing. They want my voice in their ear at the end of a long day.</p>
        <p>Voice notes are how my kept Subs hear from me between sessions. Warm ones, demanding ones, the occasional one that's just me telling you what I did with my day in a tone that makes you understand exactly how lucky you are to be hearing it.</p>
        <p>Custom audio is available: a message for a specific occasion, a recorded task, a personalized fantasy in my voice and my words, using your name and the details you've told me. This is one of the most requested things I offer, because a devoted one's name in my mouth is apparently worth a great deal to them. I understand. It would be.</p>
        <p><strong>Available to:</strong> all vetted applicants. Kept Subs receive voice notes as part of their ongoing service.</p>
        <h2>Custom <em>Content.</em></h2>
        <p>You want me, specifically. Not a video of “a” woman, but your request, made for you, with your name on my lips.</p>
        <p>Customs are made to order. A video, a photo set, a scripted scene, a JOI, a roleplay, whatever it is you've been thinking about and haven't asked for yet. Tell me the fantasy, respectfully and in detail. I'll tell you the tribute it requires. If it's something I won't do, I'll say so plainly, and you'll take it gracefully, because that's Rule One.</p>
        <p>Customs are limited, because my time is. I take a small number each month, and they go in order of who asked properly.</p>
        <p><strong>Available to:</strong> all vetted applicants. Custom requests from kept Subs get priority, always.</p>
        <h2>Tasks &amp; <em>Structure.</em></h2>
        <p>For the devoted who come to me because they don't actually want content. They want direction.</p>
        <p>Tasks are assignments I give you, tailored to you, because I've learned you well enough to know what you actually need. Sometimes it's a daily check-in. Sometimes it's a habit I'm making you build, a discipline I'm enforcing, a thing you've been avoiding that I'm no longer letting you avoid. Sometimes it's a task that has nothing to do with sex at all, and those are often the ones my Subs remember longest.</p>
        <p>This is the part of my world that isn't about pleasure; it's about being held. People with demanding careers, people who run everything, people who are the responsible one in every room they enter, come to me because for once someone is responsible for them. I take that seriously. I never give a task I won't check on, and I never check on a task carelessly.</p>
        <p><strong>Available to:</strong> kept Subs, primarily. Task-based dynamics require the consistency of an ongoing arrangement, and I don't half-do anything.</p>
        <h2>Ratings.</h2>
        <p>You send me something of yours. I tell you exactly what I think of it.</p>
        <p>Dick ratings, cum ratings, body ratings, photo ratings, whatever you're brave enough to send. This isn't a grade, it's a reaction, detailed, specific, personal, and delivered the way a woman reacts when she's actually looking. I've been told my ratings are unusually thorough. I've been told a few other things too, but we'll keep it tasteful on the website.</p>
        <p>A rating is the best lead-in there is. Those who book one almost always want more afterward, and I almost always want to give it to them, provided they've behaved.</p>
        <p><strong>Available to:</strong> all vetted applicants. Ratings are one of the easiest ways to introduce yourself to my attention.</p>
        <h2 id="kept-dynamic">The Kept <em>Dynamic.</em></h2>
        <p>This is the one that matters. Everything above is a service. This is a relationship.</p>
        <p>A kept Sub belongs to me on an ongoing basis. Consistent tributes, consistent service, my consistency in return. Priority replies. Voice notes between sessions. Tasks that are actually about you. My travel diaries before they're public. The woman behind the goddess, which is the privilege every kept Sub is really paying for, whether they know it yet or not.</p>
        <h3>New to this? <em>Start here.</em></h3>
        <p>If the word kept is new to you, that's perfectly fine. You're in good company. Read this paragraph twice and then keep going.</p>
        <p>Being kept simply means you've stopped being someone who tributes me occasionally and become someone who belongs to me. There's no contract, no paperwork, no schedule you have to memorize on day one. It's simpler than that, and harder than that. It means you show up consistently: your tributes arrive with a rhythm instead of a mood, you check in like someone with a place to belong, and you accept that in my world, the quality of your devotion matters far more than the size of any single send.</p>
        <p>Here's the thing nobody tells a beginner: you don't have to be rich to be kept. You have to be steady. I've kept Subs who send modest tributes like clockwork for years, and I've let go of those who made one grand gesture and then vanished. Consistency is the entire test. A Sub who remembers me every month, without being reminded, is worth ten of the ones who only show up when the mood strikes.</p>
        <p>And if you're worried you'll get it wrong: you probably will, once. Everyone does. You'll send too much too fast, or wait too long to send at all, or say something clumsier than you meant. I've seen every version of this. I don't punish the learning curve. I punish the pattern, which is a different thing entirely. A Sub who stumbles honestly, listens, and adjusts is exactly the kind of Sub I keep.</p>
        <p>You don't have to know what you're doing to start. You only have to be willing to learn it. That's what the intake is for. That's what I'm for.</p>
        <h3>What being kept actually <em>feels like.</em></h3>
        <p>The structure above is the frame. Here's the picture inside it.</p>
        <p>You get a goddess who remembers her loyal ones. I keep track. The people who treat me well stay on my mind long after the night ends. I'll check on you. I'll tease you. I'll send you something that makes your day. I'll make you feel seen in a way you probably haven't felt in a while.</p>
        <p>Some of my kept Subs serve me as a Daddy serves his Little. Yes, you read that correctly. In my world the caretaking runs toward me, and the structure runs toward you, and if you understand that sentence the way I mean it, you already know you're one of them.</p>
        <p>Kept positions are limited. Genuinely limited, because I refuse to keep more Subs than I can actually take care of, and I take care of Mine well. When a position opens, it goes to someone already in my world who has proven themselves over time. There's no application button for this one. There's only the long game.</p>
        <p><strong>Available to:</strong> earned. Never bought outright, though the tributes are certainly part of it.</p>
        <h2>What I Don't <em>Offer.</em></h2>
        <p>I don't do discounts. I don't do “first-time specials.” I don't negotiate tributes, and I don't refund them. I don't do free samples, because I'm not a bakery, and the devoted who belong here never asked for one.</p>
        <p>I don't offer my time to people who haven't completed an intake. I don't offer my attention to people who treat me like a service. And I don't offer anything on this page to anyone who read it looking for the cheapest option, because they were never going to be happy here, and I'd rather they find that out on this page than in my inbox.</p>
        <p>One last thing, for anyone who's read this whole page and is still deciding.</p>
        <p>I'm warm with the people who earn my warmth, and cold with the ones who waste my time. That's the whole dynamic. It's simple, and it's fair, and if you're the right person, you already know which side you want to be on.</p>
        <p>I keep very few. The ones I keep, I keep.</p>
        <p>Everything above is available. None of it is promised. What you receive in my world is what you've earned, and the devoted who earn a great deal are, without exception, the ones who started small, started respectfully, and kept showing up until I noticed.</p>
        <p>Start where everyone starts.</p>
